  message: "Fixed in PR #3114 (commit 0e74d80a1 on dev). New _ops_union_restore_file helper in scripts/lib/forgejo-api.sh replaces cp-based restore with awk-based order-preserving line-level union. Preserves both backup and rebased-working-tree ops. 8 regression tests in tests/test_autopr_ops_union_restore.py cover all scenarios."  # 28d4
